eam-3948460","kind":"announcement","title":"🚗 BUCKLE UP! IT'S NEXT FEST!","summary":"We're excited to announce that Teach My Little Sister How to Drive is officially participating in Steam Next Fest – October 2026! 🎉Haven't tried our demo yet? Now's the perfect time to jump in!Take the passenger seat, talk to your little sister using your own voice, and try to teach her how to drive.Sounds simple, right? Well… good luck with that😂🎮 Play the FREE demo on Steam!And if you enjoy the chaos, don't forget to add us to your wishlist!A huge thank you to everyone who has played, shared, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:10:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028306","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1846018067925542","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"v1.2.9 Update and a Development Status Update","summary":"Hello everyone, We’d like to share the new features in this update, along with an honest update on the issues players have been experiencing and the work we’re doing to address them. What’s newAdded emotional expressions for your little sister.Added new hair customization options. Your sister can now show her emotions through her facial expressions during conversations. This is something we’ve wanted to bring to the game for a long time, and we plan to add a wider range of emotional expressions ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T09:40:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925542","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1843481262691741","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"announcement","title":"See You at Tokyo Game Show 2026!","summary":"Hey everyone! We’ve got some exciting news to share.〈Teach My Little Sister How To Drive〉 is coming to Tokyo Game Show 2026 as part of Indie 80!Thank you so much for your interest and support. We’re thrilled to have the chance to meet you in person at the show!If you’re heading to TGS, make sure to stop by our booth!Haven’t played yet? Come try your hand at teaching your little sister how to drive. Already played? We’d love to see you, too! Drop in, play a round, and tell us what you think. Whet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T10:17:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691741","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1840310314339132","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"Graphic Update!","summary":"Hello, this is the development team! Thank you very much to everyone who has been enjoying our game.\\Visual Update!1. Complete Visual OverhaulThe game's most important assets have been completely reworked, including your little sister, the player character, and all vehicles.We've upgraded character models, textures, shaders, and animations to give the game a much more polished and consistent look.We've also replaced every asset that was previously disclosed as AI-assisted artwork with brand-new ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T13:01:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339132","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1837955055362176","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.1.1","summary":"Hello, this is the development team! Thank you very much to everyone who has been enjoying our game.\\AMD GPU Support & Major Loading Time Improvements!1. AMD GPU Support (Experimental)To address the compatibility issues experienced by our AMD graphics card users, we are finally introducing official AMD GPU support!Supported Lineups: AMD Radeon RX 6000, 7000, 8000, and 9000 series.Note: This feature is currently in an Experimental stage. If you encounter any stability or compatibility issues whil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T01:28:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055362176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1834602721201049","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.1","summary":"Hello, this is the development team! Thank you very much to everyone who has been enjoying our game.\\Sister Voice System ImprovementsThis update brings some major changes, and the game has now been updated to Version 1.1.The biggest improvement is the overhaul of the sister's voice system. Both response speed and conversation quality have been significantly enhanced, providing a smoother and more natural gameplay experience.We have also added a Voice Quality setting. Higher quality settings prov","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T07:56:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721201049","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1831432155575133","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.0.9","summary":"Hello, this is the development team! Thank you very much to everyone who has been enjoying our game.Based on the feedback we received, we have fixed the following issues.\\mph units are now supported.The younger sister’s response speed has been slightly improved.Other stability and gameplay experience improvements\\Discord: https://discord.gg/FGKPcydttyWishlist:If you haven’t added the game to your wishlist yet, clicking the “Add to Wishlist” button would mean a lot to us!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T09:49:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155575133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1828894815561951","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.0.8","summary":"Hello, this is the development team.First of all, we sincerely thank everyone who is enjoying our game.The issue with the sister’s responses has now been resolved.Additionally, based on the valuable feedback you have provided, we have made the following improvements:\\Fixed an issue where the sister would occasionally not respond.Fixed an issue where the sister would sometimes speak in a different language than the selected one.Improved overall stability and gameplay experience.We will continue t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-04T08:27:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815561951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3948460-1827626365763476","game_id":"steam-3948460","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.0.7","summary":"Hello, this is the development team.First of all, we would like to sincerely thank everyone who is enjoying our game.Through a recent hotfix, we were able to improve the sister’s response issue to some extent; however, we have confirmed that the issue still occurs intermittently.We are currently prioritizing a complete fix for this problem and will provide another update once it has been resolved. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience caused during gameplay.Additionally, based on the valu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-23T13:14:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365763476","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3948460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3948460":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3948460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3950270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:01:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3948460","app_id":3948460,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3d1ca11544bfe6281a5d7f714a32cfd1c93ff15aae33e013ea598e0bf8732098","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"여동생 운전 가르치기는 위험이 가득한 도로에서 일어나는 여동생 운전 연수 시뮬레이션 게임입니다. \r\n조수석에 꼼짝없이 갇힌 오빠로서 할 수 있는 일이라곤 제대로 운전을 가르치는 것 뿐입니다.\r\n잊지 마세요. 아무리 소리를 지르고 화를 내더라도, 여전히 운전대를 잡고 있는 건 여동생이란걸요!\r\n","publishers":[{"name":"Easy Fox","creator_clan_account_id":46112187}],"developers":[{"name":"Easy Fox","creator_clan_account_id":46112187}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801382400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Teach My Little Sister How To Drive Trailer Ko","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1785934864","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"394846